[00:12.86]1. Sing to God a song, A song of praise that’s bold and new.
[00:20.86]Tell of all the great things He’s done and yet will do.
[00:28.86]Praise his mighty arm; He is the God of victory.
[00:36.86]In the cause of justice,
[00:39.60]He judges righteously.
[00:42.34](Chorus)
[00:45.08]Sing, sing, sing!
[00:49.08]The new song, let it ring!
[00:53.08]Sing, sing, sing!
[00:56.08]Jehovah is our King.
[01:11.32]2. Make a joyful shout, A joyful cry to God, our King!
[01:19.82]Laud his name, give honor; A joyful anthem sing.
[01:27.82]Join the mighty crowd, And sing aloud before the Lord.
[01:33.28]Harp and horn and trumpet
[01:38.73]Sound praise in full accord.
[01:41.23](Chorus)
[01:43.73]Sing, sing, sing!
[01:47.73]The new song, let it ring!
[01:51.73]Sing, sing, sing!
[01:54.73]Jehovah is our King.
[02:10.36]3. Let the mighty sea And all that fills it give him praise.
[02:18.86]Join with earth’s creation, And joyful voices raise.
[02:26.86]Let the land rejoice, And let the rivers clap their hands.
[02:31.31]Mountains, hills, and valleys
[02:35.76]Sing praise in all the lands.
[02:38.09](Chorus)
[02:40.42]Sing, sing, sing!
[02:42.76]The new song, let it ring!
[02:46.76]Sing, sing, sing!
[02:50.76]Jehovah is our King.